BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 750 Tm (TITLE: Kerala Agricultural University - Kuttanad Wetland Rice Acid Saline Soil Advisory) Tj 1 0 0 1 50 732 Tm (PAGE: 2) Tj 1 0 0 1 50 714 Tm () Tj 1 0 0 1 50 696 Tm (2. Sheath Blight Management in Humid Wetlands \(Rhizoctonia solani\)) Tj 1 0 0 1 50 678 Tm (Symptoms: Oval greenish-grey water-soaked lesions on leaf sheaths near water line extending upward to flag leaves.) Tj 1 0 0 1 50 660 Tm (Management & Remedy:) Tj 1 0 0 1 50 642 Tm (Avoid dense planting; skip 8th row to provide ventilation alleys. Spray validamycin 3% L @ 2 ml per litre or azoxystrobin 25% SC @ 1 ml per litre.) Tj 1 0 0 1 50 624 Tm (Citation: KAU Plant Pathology Bulletin Kumarakom \(Page 15\).) Tj ET
